    "server": "Ollama 0.32.14 on the same computer",
    "model": "Maykeye/TinyLLama-v0 (9 MB of weights, already on the computer; converted to GGUF with the gguf Python package)",
    "note": "It produces story-like text and cannot use tools. These runs show that a worker in a container reaches a model on this computer and completes a turn with its answer, not that such a model can do useful work."
  },
